<title>USA: LIVERMORE, CALIF., WON BY BANCAMERICA.</title>
<headline>LIVERMORE, CALIF., WON BY BANCAMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Securities Inc said it won $19.780 million of Livermore, Calif., refunding and capital projects 1997 certificates of participation, with a true interest cost of 5.10 percent.</p>
